<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<!--
Photo Studio (#444): settings this feature owns that were renamed from their
upstream Alchemy names, old name -> new name. Read by SLPhotoStudioSettings
(slphotostudiosettings.cpp):

- once, at startup, to carry each old value in the user's settings.xml over to
  the new name (if the new one is still at its default); the marker
  SLPhotoStudioSettingsMigrated keeps that to one run;
- whenever a Look or a graphics preset is loaded, so files saved under the old
  names still apply.

Kept as its own table so it can be folded into the general settings rename
(#126) as data. Not here, on purpose: ALLightboxState (the old floater's tab and
window state, which has no meaning for the four-panel layout and is dropped),
and AlchemyScopePane0-3 (never declared, so never saved).
-->
<llsd>
<map>
    <key>AlchemyRenderTonemapType</key>
    <string>SlipstreamRenderTonemapType</string>
    <key>AlchemyScopeLayout</key>
    <string>SLPhotoStudioScopeLayout</string>
    <key>AlchemyScopeLogScale</key>
    <string>SLPhotoStudioScopeLogScale</string>
    <key>AlchemyScopeSampleInterval</key>
    <string>SLPhotoStudioScopeSampleInterval</string>
    <key>AlchemyScopeSampleWidth</key>
    <string>SLPhotoStudioScopeSampleWidth</string>
    <key>AlchemyScopeSmoothing</key>
    <string>SLPhotoStudioScopeSmoothing</string>
</map>
</llsd>
